{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WE WELCOME YOU TO OCEAN CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After years away from your hometown, you're running low on cash. It\u2019s time to pay a visit to an old friend in Ocean City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/2faa14418b7e878a28266311de867a1e.poster.avif?t=1773995895\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/2faa14418b7e878a28266311de867a1e.webm?t=1773995895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/2faa14418b7e878a28266311de867a1e.mp4?t=1773995895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>START YOUR BUSINESS ON THE DARKNET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acquire buildings across the city and turn them into your operational headquarters.</strong><br>Run all kinds of illegal businesses: from a cryptocurrency mining farm to stolen car sales, drug dealing... or push the limits by trafficking human organs.<br><strong>On the Darknet, everything is for sale, but the moral choice is yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/0d59aa8af889ca9f70eb3526aa7a0fb9.poster.avif?t=1773995895\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/0d59aa8af889ca9f70eb3526aa7a0fb9.webm?t=1773995895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/0d59aa8af889ca9f70eb3526aa7a0fb9.mp4?t=1773995895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR REPUTATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the darknet, rule number one is simple: <strong>trust only those who are trustworthy</strong>.<br>To make deals with the big players, you must <strong>be reliable and build your reputation</strong>.<br>The less reliable you are, the more you'll be forced to deal with desperate people, scammers, and amateur criminals... but nothing stops you from turning their own tricks against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/924910f1522772e437e261f353bff152.poster.avif?t=1773995895\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/924910f1522772e437e261f353bff152.webm?t=1773995895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/924910f1522772e437e261f353bff152.mp4?t=1773995895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An empire doesn\u2019t build itself. If you want to grow, <strong>you\u2019ll need a team</strong>.<br><strong>Build new production lines</strong> for your businesses and <strong>hire goons</strong> to handle supply, production, and delivery.<br>Protection is essential. Only then can you get rid of the criminal organizations already present in the territory and prevent them from interfering with your operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/c3059870c4f19de869ecc87884e24dea.poster.avif?t=1773995895\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/c3059870c4f19de869ecc87884e24dea.webm?t=1773995895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/c3059870c4f19de869ecc87884e24dea.mp4?t=1773995895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A WORLD RICH IN DETAIL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>vast city of Ocean City</strong> lets you play in a <strong>rich open world</strong>, where you can cause chaos in the streets, drive and customize a wide range of vehicles, buy properties around the city, party at nightclubs, or grab a burger at a fast food joint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/fe1a71346887badced6c30207cadae8c.poster.avif?t=1773995895\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/fe1a71346887badced6c30207cadae8c.webm?t=1773995895\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/fe1a71346887badced6c30207cadae8c.mp4?t=1773995895\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761450?t=1773995895","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/542e91f7e34772341ab8cd708852637ce466fd3d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773995895","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/91f350e67c1ffd202acc7207db5e87548f59c60d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773995895","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/91f350e67c1ffd202acc7207d